WEBVTT

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:03.696
I came to work each day feeling
like I was coming to work with friends.

00:01:06.101 --> 00:01:12.246
Fast-forward just three years
when I started a full-time job,

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:14.551
that community broke apart and dispersed.

00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:21.962
And instead I was in the more
sterile culture of traditional medicine

00:01:21.986 --> 00:01:25.016
with a group of people
I didn't really know that well

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:28.516
and a group of people who had lives
well outside the hospital.

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:30.727
And I remember going to work at times,